  "msgHelp": "{icoAqi} <b>AQI Notifier Bot</b> v{botVersion}\n\nThis bot monitors air quality data from your sensors and sends notifications about AQI and/or PM values transitions between pollution zones or their sudden changes.\n\n<b>Main commands:</b>\n/list — list your devices and manage subscriptions to them\n/status — latest received indicators for all your devices\n/history — history of the last 10 measurements for all your devices\n/help — main menu and this help\n/lang — change interface language and units\n\n<b>Management:</b>\n{icoBullet} Click <b>Settings -> Subscriptions</b> to add or remove a device.\n{icoBullet} In the «<b>Settings</b>» section you can change zone thresholds for PM indicators (Green/Yellow/Red) and the list of generated notifications.\n{icoBullet} You can also configure which notifications will come with sound and which silently.",
